<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>cvkwl — Веб-разработчик</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&family=Syne:wght@700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --bg: #080810;
      --surface: #0f0f1a;
      --card: #13131f;
      --green: #22c55e;
      --orange: #f97316;
      --yellow: #eab308;
      --lime: #84cc16;
      --text: #f1f0ff;
      --muted: #8b8aa8;
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 50%, rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.12) 0%, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 50%, rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.12) 0%, transparent 50%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px 48px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      background: rgba(8,8,16,0.6);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.15);
    }

    .nav-logo {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--green), var(--orange));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 32px; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a {
      color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }

    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 120px 24px 80px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .orb {
      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(80px);
      pointer-events: none;
      animation: drift 8s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }
    .orb-1 { width: 500px; height: 500px; background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2); top: 10%; left: -10%; animation-delay: 0s; }
    .orb-2 { width: 400px; height: 400px; background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.2); top: 30%; right: -8%; animation-delay: -3s; }
    .orb-3 { width: 300px; height: 300px; background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.12); bottom: 10%; left: 30%; animation-delay: -5s; }

    @keyframes drift {
      from { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
      to   { transform: translate(30px, -40px) scale(1.1); }
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.3);
      border-radius: 100px;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--green);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease both;
    }

    .badge-dot {
      width: 6px; height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--lime);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--lime);
      animation: pulse 2s ease infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:0.3} }

    h1 {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 8vw, 6rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      animation: fadeUp 0.6s 0.1s ease both;
    }

    .gradient-text {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green) 0%, var(--orange) 50%, var(--yellow) 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-size: 200% 200%;
      animation: gradShift 4s ease infinite;
    }

    @keyframes gradShift {
      0%   { background-position: 0% 50%; }
      50%  { background-position: 100% 50%; }
      100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
    }

    .hero-sub {
      max-width: 560px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      animation: fadeUp 0.6s 0.2s ease both;
    }

    .hero-cta {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      animation: fadeUp 0.6s 0.3s ease both;
    }

    .btn {
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: none;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green), var(--orange));
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.3);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.4);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .stats {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 48px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 72px;
      animation: fadeUp 0.6s 0.4s ease both;
    }

    .stat { text-align: center; }
    .stat-num {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-size: 2.4rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green), var(--orange));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    .stat-label { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }

    section { padding: 100px 24px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }

    .section-eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--green);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .section-sub {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      max-width: 520px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      margin-bottom: 56px;
    }

    .skills-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .skill-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 24px;
      transition: all 0.3s;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .skill-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.06), rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.06));
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.3s;
    }

    .skill-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: var(--green); }
    .skill-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }

    .skill-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .skill-name { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .skill-desc { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5; }

    .projects-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .project-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      border-radius: 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }

    .project-card:hover { transform: translateY(-6px); border-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.4); box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }

    .project-thumb {
      height: 200px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 4rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .thumb-1 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #064023, #0a5c2e); }
    .thumb-2 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b1a06, #5c2e0a); }
    .thumb-3 { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #063b3b, #0a5c5c); }

    .project-body { padding: 24px; }
    .project-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--green);
      background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .project-title { font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .project-desc { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; }

    .contact-box {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 64px 48px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .contact-box::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 600px;
      height: 300px;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .contact-title {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .contact-sub { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 36px; font-size: 1.05rem; }

    .contact-links {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .contact-link {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    }
    .contact-link:hover { border-color: var(--orange); background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.06); transform: translateY(-2px); }

    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      text-align: center;
      padding: 32px 24px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease; }
    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

    .divider { height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--green), var(--orange), transparent); margin: 0 auto; max-width: 1100px; }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      nav { padding: 16px 20px; }
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .contact-box { padding: 40px 24px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <nav>
    <div class="nav-logo">cvkwl</div>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#skills">Навыки</a></li>
      <li><a href="#projects">Проекты</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Контакт</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <div class="hero">
    <div class="orb orb-1"></div>
    <div class="orb orb-2"></div>
    <div class="orb orb-3"></div>

    <div class="badge">
      <span class="badge-dot"></span>
      Открыт для заказов
    </div>

    <h1>
      Создаю сайты<br>
      <span class="gradient-text">которые продают</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-sub">
      Делаю современные, быстрые и красивые сайты. Под ключ — от дизайна до запуска.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Написать мне</a>
      <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-secondary">Смотреть работы</a>
    </div>

    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-num">5+</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Проектов</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-num">100%</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Довольных клиентов</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-num">6+</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Месяцев опыта</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <section id="skills">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Что умею</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Мои навыки</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Разрабатываю как простые лендинги, так и сложные веб-приложения с нуля.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="skills-grid reveal">
      <div class="skill-card">
        <div class="skill-icon">🎨</div>
        <div class="skill-name">UI/UX Дизайн</div>
        <div class="skill-desc">Красивые интерфейсы которые удобно использовать</div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-card">
        <div class="skill-icon">⚡</div>
        <div class="skill-name">HTML & CSS</div>
        <div class="skill-desc">Верстаю пиксель в пиксель по любому макету</div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-card">
        <div class="skill-icon">🔧</div>
        <div class="skill-name">JavaScript</div>
        <div class="skill-desc">Анимации, интерактив, работа с API</div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-card">
        <div class="skill-icon">📱</div>
        <div class="skill-name">Адаптивность</div>
        <div class="skill-desc">Сайты отлично выглядят на любом устройстве</div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-card">
        <div class="skill-icon">🚀</div>
        <div class="skill-name">Скорость</div>
        <div class="skill-desc">Оптимизирую загрузку и производительность</div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-card">
        <div class="skill-icon">🤖</div>
        <div class="skill-name">Telegram-боты</div>
        <div class="skill-desc">Разработка ботов и мини-приложений для Telegram</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <section id="projects">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Портфолио</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Мои проекты</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Несколько работ которые я сделал для клиентов и для себя.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="projects-grid reveal">
      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-thumb thumb-1">🛒</div>
        <div class="project-body">
          <span class="project-tag">Интернет-магазин</span>
          <div class="project-title">Онлайн-магазин одежды</div>
          <p class="project-desc">Полноценный магазин с каталогом, корзиной и оформлением заказа.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-thumb thumb-2">📊</div>
        <div class="project-body">
          <span class="project-tag">Лендинг</span>
          <div class="project-title">Сайт для бизнеса</div>
          <p class="project-desc">Продающий лендинг с анимациями и формой захвата заявок.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="project-card">
        <div class="project-thumb thumb-3">🤖</div>
        <div class="project-body">
          <span class="project-tag">Telegram</span>
          <div class="project-title">Мини-приложение в TG</div>
          <p class="project-desc">Веб-приложение внутри Telegram с красивым интерфейсом.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <section id="contact">
    <div class="contact-box reveal">
      <h2 class="contact-title">Нужен сайт? <span class="gradient-text">Напиши мне!</span></h2>
      <p class="contact-sub">Расскажи о своём проекте — обсудим детали и сделаем что-то крутое вместе.</p>
      <div class="contact-links">
        <a href="#" class="contact-link">
          <span>✈️</span> Telegram
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="contact-link">
          <span>📧</span> Email
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>cvkwl — создаю сайты, которые работают на вас</p>
  </footer>

  <script>
    const els = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
    const io = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
      entries.forEach(e => { if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add('visible'); io.unobserve(e.target); } });
    }, { threshold: 0.15 });
    els.forEach(el => io.observe(el));
  </script>
</body>
</html>
